<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-22T16:30:00.040Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Navy and French Navy conducted a bilateral maritime exercise, while the Philippines and Finland discussed maritime security cooperation and signed a pact that includes Australian drone and cybersecurity assistance. The Philippine Coast Guard increased its presence in Talisay and tightened mineral shipment checks in Cebu, and rescued 22 people from a distressed boat off Palawan. President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr. expressed optimism for improved relations with China after speaking with Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi in Shenzhen. The UCDP reported 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/china-asean-countries-struggle-over-south-china-sea-code-of-conduct/a-80009799?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPTVpNQ0wtMVAyamlvNmlHUGxuY29vTXlhX085QW5yOWY0WjU2dVM2cFYxdU9CcjVtTHVuVXRSSDlod2xPV2V3T2lESU90VDZ2eE9ldV9JblI3bHZHMVg5TXd6YjhOZC1iclZZU0RfQ2NYWUN2cWw1UlZfVXdyYVhDdU9WbGcyazFtN2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQVFQtejBOUGN0ZDRxUjZodldlNmxiT1pPbFF6dGZ4X0lMakFDX1FHRURjcW5acVRSbEI2MlBMYTd4X19pU1ZVOXZJUFdIWHRZYzh3MXY1NHc5LS0tbC1HUHJzdzY4RDdBS19lQTFPZlNTbWtsMzgzYV9TM21EYThaODdkbjUxQ0JBV0RrbnB0Tnl1R1F5UzBiM1NyTXFLaEJudVR0N1d0RXRZZzBC?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQUjlEeUpRVUFJQTBaeWtxZkxXVU1UX3J4bFM4eTA4cmc1cFdaWS0wbWpycllxSk4wMnNJbzJPdDlzakU1OFdnblNfMkVkR05rWm83Z2JmRDV0aWh3V3E0dzJ4S09VODN2YmRZX1h2dllJcThsTm9zOW9rcld1Xy1haE9GSVZwbjFpX3hCLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Scandasia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFV